    "body": "## SUPERSEDED — LEGACY FOUR-ROLE ORCHESTRATOR\n\nFresh main uses DUNCAN PRIME as the single root, #251 as the only product NEXT router, and has retired the old R03 executor automation. This PR is stacked on the now-closed #109 Foundation Integration and implements a four-role `JINGO / LESTER / DUNCAN / DJANGO` Work/event execution core around PR #111.\n\nThat topology is no longer current authority and no active product/security blocker requires it.\n\nDisposition: close unmerged as `SUPERSEDED / HISTORICAL`. No production activation is lost; this PR never established one.",
